{"id":"44b877e4bba023fa","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cyk-split-count.md","title":"CYK 子串分割候选的精确数量","display":"thm-cyk-split-count — CYK 子串分割候选的精确数量","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cyk-split-count","aliases":["73-thm-cyk-split-count"],"display":"thm-cyk-split-count — CYK 子串分割候选的精确数量","depends_on":["[[73-df-cyk-table]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.4.4, print pp. 303–307; PDF pp. 325–329; local exact operation-count component","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cyk-split-count"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cyk-split-count</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cyk-split-count — CYK 子串分割候选的精确数量"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"efcd33b278c102f5\" href=\"?note=efcd33b278c102f5\" title=\"73-df-cyk-table\">73-df-cyk-table</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.4.4, print pp. 303–307; PDF pp. 325–329; local exact operation-count component"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，下标三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,\\ell,k)\">\\((i,\\ell,k)\\)</span> 分别表示从零开始的子串起点、子串长度和切分位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\ell,k)\\in\\mathbb N^3:0\\le i&lt;n,\\ 1\\le\\ell\\le n-i,\\ 1\\le k&lt;\\ell\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\ell,k)\\in\\mathbb N^3:0\\le i&lt;n,\\ 1\\le\\ell\\le n-i,\\ 1\\le k&lt;\\ell\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal T_n|=\\sum_{\\ell=2}^{n}(n-\\ell+1)(\\ell-1)=\\frac{n(n-1)(n+1)}6.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathcal T_n|=\\sum_{\\ell=2}^{n}(n-\\ell+1)(\\ell-1)=\\frac{n(n-1)(n+1)}6.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对长度 ℓ 有 n−ℓ+1 个子串，每个有 ℓ−1 个切分点。逐个测试二叉产生式时，这一数量乘以二叉产生式数给出主要候选工作量；长度一的初始化另行计算。n=0、1 时均为零，不对空输入建立不存在的表格单元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cyk-table","status":"resolved","id":"efcd33b278c102f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cyk-table]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(i,\\ell,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\ell,k)\\in\\mathbb N^3:0\\le i<n,\\ 1\\le\\ell\\le n-i,\\ 1\\le k<\\ell\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"|\\mathcal T_n|=\\sum_{\\ell=2}^{n}(n-\\ell+1)(\\ell-1)=\\frac{n(n-1)(n+1)}6.","display":true}],"bytes":1339,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-cyk-split-count|CYK 子串分割候选的精确数量]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["efcd33b278c102f5"]}